== Usage ==
A '''Booster''' can be applied to [[Axes]], [[Armor]], and [[Equipment]] in an [[Anvil]] for {{c}}. '''Boosters''' grant varying buffs based on the item they are applied to. '''Boosters''' can also be salvaged for {{Item|Forest Essence|amount = 5}}. 

To apply '''Uncommon Booster Upgrade''' to the item, it is required to have an already applied '''Common Booster'''.

== Interface ==
A list of items that Boosters can be applied to can seen by clicking the Booster on display next to {{NPCSprite|Sawyer}}.
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==

* To obtain enough common boosters and uncommon boosters for a full set of armor, equipment and axe, it would cost {{Item|Agatha's Coupon|amount=900}}, {{Item|Forest Essence|amount=2250}}, {{C|450k}}, {{Item|Figstone|amount=45}}, {{Item|Mangcore|amount=45}} and {{Item|Helixis|amount=45}}.
** With every uncommon booster applied across 9 items (4 armor pieces, 4 equipments, 1 axe), the total stats granted are {{Stat|Sweep|38}}, {{Stat|Foraging Fortune|80}}, {{Stat|Foraging Wisdom|15}}, {{Stat|Hunting Wisdom|15}} and {{Stat|Damage|+38%}} against Foraging Island Creatures.

